<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 9.95 / 9.85  10.30 /10.20    10.70 /10.60</p>
<p>BPI			 9.95 / 9.75  10.25 /10.125   10.725/10.70</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.025/ 9.95  10.20 /10.15    10.715/10.675</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	  9.975/ 9.875 10.25 /10.185   10.725/10.70</p>
<p>Multinational	   9.85 / 9.75  10.375/10.25    10.75 /10.625</p>
<p>Security Bank	   9.95 / 9.85  10.30 /10.20    10.80 /10.70</p>
<p>Solidbank		 9.95 / 9.90  10.24 /10.19    10.75 /10.70</p>
<p>StandChart Bank	10.00 / 9.90  10.30 /10.20    10.75 /10.65</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
